{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39900","headline":"逐臭苍蝇 · 徐夤","name":"逐臭苍蝇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐臭苍蝇岂有爲，清蝉吟露最高奇。\n多藏苟得何名富，饱食嗟来未胜饥。\n穷寂不妨延寿考，贪狂总待算毫厘。\n首阳山翠千年在，好奠冰壶吊伯夷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}